; Materialization corpus: an expression default whose head declares a
; matching `:result` but ships no `:impl` clears Schema.validateDefaults
; (declared number == key number) and clears Validator.validate (the
; omitted `:radius` is `effectiveOptional`), then fails at runtime when
; `Expr.evalBinary` reaches `applyFunction` and returns
; `PluginFuncNotImplemented`. The host emits `default_eval_failed` at
; the document path of the defaulted key.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (expr-func :name nope :arity (fixed 0) :result number)
  (form :name circle
    (key :name radius :type number :default (nope))))

(circle)
